# The folder URL (/phan-tich-du-lieu-voi-r/) must open index.html. On 20/11/2026, once this folder had held an
# .htaccess, the hosting (LiteSpeed) sent that URL to the main site's PHP instead, and kept doing so after the file
# was removed. Naming the index here keeps the folder URL on the page.
DirectoryIndex index.html
